        "switch",
        "master"
      ],
      "cwd": ".",
      "stdout": "",
      "stderr": "Warning: you are leaving 1 commit behind, not connected to\nany of your branches:\n\n  6a23a33 on detached\n\nIf you want to keep it by creating a new branch, this may be a good time\nto do so with:\n\n git branch <new-branch-name> 6a23a33\n\nSwitched to branch 'master'\n",
      "exit": 0
    },
    {
      "git": [
        "switch",
